+multilink, to compress independently on individual links of a
+multilink bundle.  This value <bcp14>MAY</bcp14> be compressed when LCP
+Protocol-Field-Compression is negotiated.</t>
+          </dd>
+          <dt pn="section-2.1-3.3">Compressed Data</dt>
+          <dd pn="section-2.1-3.4">
